#: ../../tools/open_meteo_flood_tools.rst:32 97e4c7a38d8e4899aa9720cce6d3becb
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get river discharge and flood forecast data for any "
"location using Open-Meteo's free GloFAS (Global Flood Awareness System) "
"API. Returns daily river discharge forecasts up to 210 days ahead, based "
"on the Copernicus Emergency Management Service. Useful for flood risk "
"assessment, water resource management, hydropower planning, and climate "
"research. Data resolution is 0.05 degrees (~5km). Latitude/longitude "
"required (use OpenMeteo\\_geocode\\_location for coordinates)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/open_meteo_flood_tools.rst:34 0171503b6fcf4646a0db05169fc245ea
msgid "**Parameters:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/open_meteo_flood_tools.rst:36 6ff1d251f7dc47ce9faa2eb98e312af0
msgid ""
"``latitude`` (number) (required) Latitude in decimal degrees (e.g., 52.52"
" for Berlin, 48.85 for Paris, 29.76 for Houston)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/open_meteo_flood_tools.rst:39 f91a37d6fe944458bd521246eb54d875
msgid ""
"``longitude`` (number) (required) Longitude in decimal degrees (e.g., "
"13.41 for Berlin, 2.35 for Paris, -95.37 for Houston)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/open_meteo_flood_tools.rst:42 21a72b5bfc7548b48e3be756b8ea7679
msgid ""
"``daily`` (string, null) (optional) Comma-separated daily variables. "
"Options: river\\_discharge, river\\_discharge\\_mean, "
"river\\_discharge\\_median, river\\_discharge\\_max, "
"river\\_discharge\\_min, river\\_discharge\\_p25, "
"river\\_discharge\\_p75. Default: river\\_discharge."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/open_meteo_flood_tools.rst:45 1df0183f554146cda55fd77e2d02f6ed
msgid ""
"``forecast_days`` (integer, null) (optional) Number of forecast days "
"(1-210, default 92). GloFAS provides seasonal forecasts up to 210 days."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/open_meteo_flood_tools.rst:48 c133ac067a8a4058b2c609fd22022405
msgid ""
"``past_days`` (integer, null) (optional) Number of past days to include "
"(0-92, default 0). Includes recent historical discharge data."
msgstr ""

